# Resource-type coverage — caseload
library "Resource Coverage Cases".
covers "Resource Coverage".

fact "Test Patient":
- name is "Test Patient".
- birth date is "1980-01-01".
- defined by "Patient".

// Each fact's local `{system, code}` is DERIVED from its backing concept (T3b derive-local),
// not authored here; the `date is` drives the per-resource date element (Procedure.performedDateTime,
// Observation.effectiveDateTime, MedicationRequest.authoredOn).
fact "Assessment Done":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Resource Coverage"."Screening Assessment".

fact "Procedure Performed":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Resource Coverage"."Stimulator Procedure".

fact "Medication Ordered":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Resource Coverage"."Requested Medication".

case "All resource types present":
- description is `Exercises Observation + Procedure + MedicationRequest case-feature emit.`.
- subject is "Test Patient".
- fact is "Assessment Done".
- fact is "Procedure Performed".
- fact is "Medication Ordered".
- result is "Resource Coverage" is "certify.Approve".
